OL,3,GNEWSAPM not ruling out inquiry into
OL,4,Afuneral scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister says he is "not
OL,7,Fgoing to rule out" a public inquiry
OL,8,Finto the Legacy funeral home scandal.
OL,10,FAndy Burnham said he was "shocked to my
OL,11,Fcore" by the case which saw Hull
OL,12,Ffuneral home owner Robert Bush jailed
OL,13,Ffor 20 years after admitting failing to
OL,14,Fbury or cremate people and giving
OL,15,Fbereaved relatives the ashes of
OL,16,Fstrangers.
OL,18,F"I cannot do anything other than just
OL,19,Ffeel with everything I've got for the
OL,20,Ffamilies who've been affected," said
OL,21,FBurnham.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
