OL,3,GNEWSAPM not ruling out inquiry into
OL,4,Afuneral scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving recently suffered the loss of
OL,7,Fhis father, he said he could not
OL,8,Fimagine the "extra distress" that
OL,9,Ffamilies of Bush's victims must have
OL,10,Ffaced.
